# Runtime config for this app.
#
# Ignition reads THIS file at the exact commit it deploys and injects every
# KEY=VALUE below into the running container's environment:
#   - a release and "Deploy from main" read main's .env
#   - a PR preview reads that PR branch's .env — change a value on a branch and
#     only its preview picks it up
#
# It's committed, so it's plaintext in git history: fine for hackathon-grade
# keys, not for anything you'd genuinely protect. For values you only want
# locally, put them in .env.local (gitignored — Docker Compose loads it on top
# automatically when you `docker compose up`).
#
# PORT is set by Ignition; don't put it here.

# AIRLABS_API_KEY=
